.MARINE...
(Tonight through next Tuesday)
Issued at 1222 PM PDT Thu Aug 27 2026

Fresh northwest breezes with occasional near gale force gusts
persist through the weekend and ease by early next week. Wind
driven  seas remain moderate into next week as a long period
southerly swell  around 16 to 18 seconds approaches our coastal
waters by Friday  morning.

